<1>S3. I_FreshS'
  <2>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q \in M, NEW e \in sPres[q], e >= nextSeq \/ ~conf[e], NEW x \in Blocks
               PROVE  sCon[q][e][x] >= cutAck[q][e][x]
