<1>8. I_FreshS2' BY <1>v, <1>K, <1>i, <1>n, <1>u DEF I_FreshS2
<1>9. J_SeqLe'
  <2>1. \A q \in R : stamp'[q].seq <= nseq'
    <3>. SUFFICES ASSUME NEW q \in R PROVE stamp'[q].seq <= nseq' OBVIOUS
